{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DeckTerra\u00a0</i></strong>is a <strong> Roguelike</strong>\u00a0<strong>Deckbuilder</strong> with automation elements. Build a satisfying chain of resource production to get rich and expand your city.  <br><br>In <strong><i>DeckTerra</i></strong>, you must make difficult decisions about which resources to produce, and how to optimize your production pipeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Can you last until day 100?</strong></i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build An Assembly Line</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together the buildings in your empire to merge and upgrade resources! These resources provide gold which you can use to further expand your city.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760980/extras/c1f7d59f8159d2efdab6535698252f12.poster.avif?t=1762720487\" width=616 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760980/extras/c1f7d59f8159d2efdab6535698252f12.webm?t=1762720487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760980/extras/c1f7d59f8159d2efdab6535698252f12.mp4?t=1762720487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand Your Empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make impactful decisions about which buildings to add to your city, each with their unique strengths and strategies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760980/extras/645b61e2e7545473b59d2c57f3e3d4ac.poster.avif?t=1762720487\" width=616 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760980/extras/645b61e2e7545473b59d2c57f3e3d4ac.webm?t=1762720487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760980/extras/645b61e2e7545473b59d2c57f3e3d4ac.mp4?t=1762720487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spend Your Gold Wisely</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase <strong>Relics</strong> and <strong>Items</strong> in the shop that change the rules and unlock new strategies. Manage your economy to pay ever-increasing taxes.<strong> How long will your empire last?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760980/extras/410ebfae1aee06be350a6766d4dab5d7.poster.avif?t=1762720487\" width=616 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760980/extras/410ebfae1aee06be350a6766d4dab5d7.webm?t=1762720487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760980/extras/410ebfae1aee06be350a6766d4dab5d7.mp4?t=1762720487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3760980?t=1762720487","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760980/aa502f0c2a00e6f5ac5adc7c8f2974eab9e2c6a3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762720487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760980/0faf0ab4bd8a16371f98ddfe2fc06cdf02c9671f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762720487","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760980/0faf0ab4bd